      "username": "FeelNFine",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/feelnfine/{size}/2713_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-12T06:04:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This idea is a combination of my impatience and love for coutdowns mixed with teasers. &nbsp;Would it be possible for &gt;Games and Playtesters to organise a card callender, so that every so often (hopeful emphasis on the often) someone releases a card up for discussion and general building of hype. &nbsp;</p><p>If playtesters got to write the posts and give their opinions with it, it would make for neat prieview. &nbsp;I don't know if &gt;Games released spoilers along with previous expansions, but if so it would be cool to see play testers take the reigns a little. &nbsp;What can I say? &nbsp;It hurts to see [REDACTED] in general discussion, and man is May far away.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
