      "created_at": "2012-12-12T06:10:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We're certainly not allowed to release info on specific cards. We didn't much of anything like this last time, so I doubt it'll be what you're hoping for. I think the most we can hope for is the final art update, and then maybe a piece of art periodically until May. Obviously, they don't want to give much away, and certainly not specific cards.</p>",
