      "created_at": "2012-12-12T11:37:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I certainly didn't mean without &gt;Game's permission, I just meant having playtesters do the write ups, and lead the discussion on their card. &nbsp;Now that I think about it more, the games/companies that used that strategy did so to help sell preorders, so I guess there really isn't that much hope. Ah well, I'm one of those guys who's more interested in the text than the art, but I will have to be patient.&nbsp;</p>",
